msgctxt "296\t356"
msgid "Rikiya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "387\t447"
msgid "Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "490\t604"
msgid "Oh how I've missed you, Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "605\t665"
msgid "Lau!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "666\t843"
msgid ""
"We're overdue for a little talk.\\n"
"So I thought I'd lure you out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864\t941"
msgid "I know what you're after."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "945\t1068"
msgid ""
"He has nothing to do with this!\\n"
"Let him go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076\t1176"
msgid "You fail to understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1463\t1710"
msgid ""
"My alliance with Hamazaki was forged\\n"
"for nothing more than revenge. On you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1835\t1900"
msgid "And that's why you got Rikiya involved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2271\t2432"
msgid ""
"Now, let us put an end to this\\n"
"at last... Kazuma Kiryu!"
msgstr ""